        <h1>The Binance hack: what the $6.3B theft <em>means for your money</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">Hackers drained Binance's hot wallets on 29 October 2026 in the largest crypto theft on record. Here is what is confirmed, what is only claimed, whether your money is safe or insured, and the scams to expect next, in plain English.</p>
