          <li>Decrypt, <a href="https://decrypt.co/382285/binance-hack-why-offshore-exchanges-need-us-oversight-cftc-chair" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CFTC chair on offshore exchanges</a>, 30 October 2026. The National, <a href="https://www.thenationalnews.com/future/technology/2026/10/30/binance-pledges-to-cover-63bn-hack-losses-after-massive-crypto-theft/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Binance pledges to cover losses</a>, 30 October 2026. The Block, <a href="https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-10-30-trump-looking-into-binance-hack-calls-grow-for-crypto-rules-432236" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">calls grow for crypto rules</a>, 30 October 2026. Better Markets, <a href="https://bettermarkets.substack.com/p/learning-the-hard-way-what-the-binance" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learning the hard way</a>, 30 October 2026. Abu Dhabi FSRA, <a href="https://www.adgm.com/media/announcements/fsra-statement-regarding-security-incident-involving-binance" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">statement on the Binance incident</a>, October 2026.</li>
