          <li>FBI, <a href="https://www.ic3.gov/PSA/2025/PSA250226" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">North Korea responsible for the Bybit theft</a>, 26 February 2025, and <a href="https://www.ic3.gov/PSA/2025/PSA250813" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">fictitious law firms warning</a>, 13 August 2025. IC3, <a href="https://www.ic3.gov/AnnualReport/Reports/2025_IC3Report.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">2025 annual report</a>.</li>
