          <li>FDIC, <a href="https://www.fdic.gov/news/fact-sheets/crypto-fact-sheet-7-28-22.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">crypto fact sheet</a>, 2022. FINRA, <a href="https://www.finra.org/investors/investing/investment-products/crypto-assets/risks" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">crypto asset risks</a>. FCA, <a href="https://www.fca.org.uk/consumers/crypto-investment-scams" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">crypto investment scams</a>, updated 2026.</li>
          <li>SEC staff, <a href="https://www.investor.gov/introduction-investing/general-resources/news-alerts/alerts-bulletins/investor-bulletins/crypto-asset-custody-basics-retail-investors-investor-bulletin-0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Crypto Asset Custody Basics for Retail Investors</a>, December 2025. PCAOB, <a href="https://pcaobus.org/resources/information-for-investors/investor-advisories/investor-advisory-exercise-caution-with-third-party-verification-proof-of-reserve-reports" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">proof of reserve investor advisory</a>, 2023, as reported by <a href="https://accountingtoday.com/news/pcaob-warns-about-limitations-on-crypto-proof-of-reserve-reports" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Accounting Today</a>. IRS, <a href="https://www.irs.gov/filing/digital-assets" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">digital assets</a>, 2026.</li>
