" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mt. Gox deadline</a> (Crypto Briefing), <a href="https://foxbusiness.com/markets/sam-bankman-fried-sentenced" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FTX</a> (Fox Business), <a href="https://fortune.com/2026/04/17/senator-blumenthal-binance-doj-fincen-treasury-monitorships-status/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Binance 2023 settlement</a> (Fortune).</li>
